Dallas Buyers Club is a drama, history film directed by Jean-Marc Vallée.

3
00:10:38,181 --> 00:10:44,181
Loosely based on the true-life tale of Ron Woodroof, a drug-taking, women-loving, homophobic
man who in 1986 was diagnosed with HIV/AIDS and given thirty days to live.

4
